WEBVTT

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.690
You still don't know if Jin's alive?

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.290
We can't say anything for certain,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.200
but we have faith that he is all right.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:19.380
Jin was the last child to be born on Altair.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.460
Let's avoid losing him if we can.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.460
That aside...

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:28.600
Look at the combat data he sent back from Vega.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.840
Mikage may have been right all along.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.470
About what?

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.760
The most powerful Rare Igura we're looking for...

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:41.200
is probably close to the Machine Angel.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:47.270
I won't stand for this!

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.280
We're not authorized to sortie?

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.360
The orders are to stand by until Jin's safety is confirmed.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.120
Well, I'm not going to sit tight and wait.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.040
We're going to Vega, even if we have to go alone!

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:57.900
Yeah!

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.490
How beautiful.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.030
I'm a bit envious of Jin.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:10.250
I didn't think he was so loved by his men.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.500
Who are you?

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:19.160
Brave and loyal soldiers, may you always have hope...

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.410
My holes!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.340
Someone's filled them again.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:10.180
You think this was all one person?

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.170
So cold and hard...

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:17.920
I'll find that lonely girl and dig a tunnel into her heart!

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:22.440
You still don't know if it's a girl.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:30.940
A luxurious restaurant with a breathtaking night view!

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.460
Wow!

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.240
Are you going on a date, Sazanka?

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.020
Not me.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.560
But Shrade and Cayenne... Ooh!

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.080
What about Cayenne?

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.520
Oh, nothing.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:47.030
I just don't have a partner like you do, so...

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:49.260
A partner?

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.380
Amata.

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.790
Amata isn't my partner!

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:55.620
I'll take him if you don't want him.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:02.700
Neo-Kowloon has some really
charming little hole-in-the-wall places.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.760
That's filthy!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.510
That's a magazine for dirty boys with no standards and inappropriate goals!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.520
Seriously?

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.600
"Hole-in-the-wall"? Disgusting!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.400
I never want to see you reading about such pollution again!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.150
Did I strike a nerve?

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.200
Maybe...

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:28.380
You didn't find anything in the Abductor wreck?

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:32.220
Correct. We're certain that the machine was piloted, but...

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:34.420
We'll continue our investigation.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:38.540
Don't touch that chocolate donut. I want it.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.720
I'm sorry.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:41.240
Oh...

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.550
It's Shrade.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:48.470
His tone is getting brighter.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:55.140
But darkness continues to grow in his heart.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:09.620
You can come in.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.580
You want to tell me something?

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.500
Don't be shy.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:22.540
We can't find any traces of the pilot from that wrecked Abductor robot.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:23.760
Do you sense anything?

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.520
I'm sorry. No, I don't.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:31.180
But I'm glad that you came to ask me.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:35.360
Just use your power to sense those tones of yours.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.450
Don't go out into battle again.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:39.160
Are you worried about me?

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.530
I just don't need any thrill-seekers on my team.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:47.940
All those dark visions are making you jaded.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:52.920
You won't be able to hear the sound of your sister's heart.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.290
Mikono?

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.280
She's making a lovely sound.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.820
It's expanding in harmony.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:14.740
The Berlin's gone, though. Why are you still digging?

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.260
Digging is my life.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:19.800
If I stop digging, I'll die.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:21.190
What are you, a shark?

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.560
But seriously, why holes?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.200
Beacause a new world awaits on the other side.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.490
Dig a tunnel through a mountain,

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:36.020
and you'll encounter new places, new cultures.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.370
And so our world expands.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.960
Dig down to water and make a well,

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.840
and people will gather.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.820
And so we gain prosperity.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:46.090
That's the story of mankind's progress.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.800
Wow, Andy.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.510
I never knew this digging stuff was so deep.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:55.260
So what new world this hole is leading to?

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.840
The public bath in the girls' dorms.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:58.520
What?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:04.240
I guess you could call that a new world.

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.630
It was you?

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.880
It was you!

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.120
Of all the girls, it had to be you.

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:31.630
No, perhaps this too is destiny!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.240
Our powers are complete opposites,

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.970
so they attract with the force of a black hole!

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.730
Your big bangs are just waiting to make my universe!

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.230
What are you talking about?!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:49.660
Do you have any idea what you're doing?

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:50.490
Of course I do!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.860
I'm digging a hole... for you!

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:55.740
For me?

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.830
Yes! A hole to connect both of us!

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.000
Stay at least a meter away from me!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.240
I don't want to be dirtied by your taint!

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:06.130
What?

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.100
Why are you digging all these holes?

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:09.920
I always have to fill them up!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.620
And just who asked you to fill them?

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:14.760
Those are my holes! I like my holes!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.890
I think there's a hole in your head!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.640
Go away! Get out of my sight!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:23.690
Go fall into a landfill hole!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:29.440
How dare you! My holes are my life!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:34.200
Can you guys stop fighting and help me?

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.180
Andy and Mix?

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:46.920
But their teamwork would be full of holes.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.090
What do you hope to achieve with this?

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:50.750
A hole...

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:51.590
A hole?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.580
They say many things about holes.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.850
No holes ventured, no things gained.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.220
Whosoever diggeth a pit shall fall therein.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.220
Birds of a feather occupy the same hole together.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:04.200
Bros before holes.

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.230
No one says that...

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:11.230
So you see, holes can be different things to different people.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:14.320
And why are you including Mikono?

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.990
Her Element power is still unknown.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.840
The donut is an empty space surrounded by a ring.

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.680
That's what you said, Fudo.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:26.000
And Mikono Suzushiro is that ring, surrounding nothing.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:28.750
That is not merely nothing.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:33.500
Within it is all things, even existence itself.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:38.520
We will see what meaning they can impart to holes.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.220
Why did they pick me?

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:45.720
I'm not like the other pilots. I don't have a power.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:49.230
But you did okay in the last battle.

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:53.460
I'm sure Commander Fudo and the instructors have their reasons.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:57.520
Never! I won't do it!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.160
I'll never Unite with him!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:04.250
Come on, Mix! Everyone has a first time!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:09.170
Don't be shy. You shouldn't be shy...

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:14.420
I'd rather Unite with that green cat than him!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.180
Never! Don't make me do this!

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.860
What's the matter with you, Andy?

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:22.600
Uniting with a girl is your dream, isn't it?

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:27.780
I don't think I trust their reasons.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:35.440
Andy! Mix! Let's Unite!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:40.380
Let me out! I'm not Uniting with a pathetic hole dweller!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.030
Hey! Take back what you said about holes!

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.080
Shut up! There's a hole where your brain should be!

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:44.820
Say what?!

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:45.980
I said shut up!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.790
Everybody calm down!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.960
Aborting the simulation!

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:55.860
I can't do it!

00:10:55.860 --> 00:11:00.560
I'm so useless that I can't even get them to Unite!

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:23.560
Why do I have to be the hole puncher?

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:27.700
It's our punishment for refusing to Unite.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:32.710
It's not my fault! It's their fault for
trying to set me up with the likes of you!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:35.960
You think I like this? Let me tell you—

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.540
Quiet! Just don't talk to me anymore!

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:42.720
Why do I have to deal with men who
might as well have crawled out of a hole?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:48.220
Come on, do you hate holes or dudes?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:51.480
I hate both of them! I hate holes and I hate men!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:55.160
You wouldn't be here if it wasn't for men!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.580
Where would you be if your dad didn't exist, huh?

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:01.560
Don't mention him.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.900
Don't let them get you down, Mikono.

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:19.800
But I could have done better...

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:23.700
I don't think anyone could've gotten those two to work together.

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:28.310
But why does Mix hate guys so much?

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.820
Zessica explained it to us...

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:32.580
Hm?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.320
Her dad... was a writer for a magazine?

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:43.100
He wrote reviews and guides about sightseeing attractions.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:48.440
He met a woman at a little hole-in-
the-wall bath house, fell in love, and...

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.400
I see... So that's why she hates holes.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.320
But everyone's been through hardships.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:00.600
We all get over it and bury our problems.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.590
I suppose, but...

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:16.320
There's a hole in that girl's heart.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.520
And she's been trying to fill it...

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:19.500
Whoa!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:24.680
Ow! Hey, who put this hole here?

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.740
Oh, wait. It was me.

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:46.680
I'll get you, Machine Angel, and avenge Master Jin!

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:52.440
Mikage! You've manipulated their minds!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:54.680
Your words hurt me.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:59.140
I just gave them a little gift.

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:02.160
What did you give them?

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.440
A dream.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:05.360
What are you after?

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:09.570
Do you want the true Eve for yourself?

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:13.860
If everyone admires a single flower,

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:17.210
there's no reason for a whole garden to bloom.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.600
<i>Abductors detected!</i>

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:21.860
<i>All Elements, please report to phase one battle stations!</i>

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:26.220
<i>Repeat: All Elements, please report to phase one battle stations!</i>

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:29.300
Based on the behavior of the recent Abductors,

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.720
it seems that their goals have changed.

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:36.230
They've been appearing closer to the Neo-Kowloon area, too.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:38.180
There are only three enemy machines.

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:40.230
We should send out a solid, reliable team.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.340
Deploy...

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.480
Andy W. Hol as the head.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.360
Roger! Wait. What?

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:47.990
Finally!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.360
With Mix and Mikono.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.660
Wait a second! I refuse to go with a boy!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:58.100
Mix! This is a real battle!

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.290
Now isn't the time to be selfish!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.800
Go get 'em, Mikono.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.640
Vector X, launching!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.180
Vector Y, launching!

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.860
Vector Z, launching!

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.020
I've waited a long time for this!

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:34.120
Come on! Let's make it a rousing Union!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:34.780
No!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:35.370
What?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:39.180
I won't do it! I won't Unite with a boy!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:40.000
Mix!

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:42.840
I can handle them by myself!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.670
Take this!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.430
Oh, no!

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.020
Mix!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:08.960
Andy?

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.150
Get over yourself!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.680
I don't blame you for trying to fill that hole in your heart!

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:19.300
But you can't just push away anything that has to do with guys!

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:22.040
It's like you're...

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:27.460
I know! It's like you're in a pit!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.880
What does that even mean?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:34.220
It means you're not filling the hole, just closing yourself inside it!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:39.310
You can throw in as much dirt as you want, but you'll never fill it!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:41.480
If you want to fill the hole, you have to dig yourself out first!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:46.400
Let me fill the hole in your heart with the dirt from mine!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.990
Listen up, Mix!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:50.440
My very first mixed Union...

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.950
can't be with anyone else but you!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:55.700
Andy...

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.060
Mix, let's Unite.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.700
Believe in Andy.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:02.200
The aura levels of all Elements are rising!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:05.880
80... 85... they keep going up!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:15.320
The holes I have to fill are the ones in my heart...

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:16.980
Let's do it, Mix, Mikono!

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:17.960
Roger!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.220
Roger!

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:25.230
Big Bang Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:35.840
What is this? It's completely different to doing it with girls!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.700
My heart is beating really hard, too...

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:41.580
I'm going to make it! I'm tunneling through!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:47.330
I'm going to expand my world!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.580
I won't let you finish!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.640
Mix!

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.630
Out of the way!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.180
Andy!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.520
Andy!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.180
Fudo!

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.970
Element Change!

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:08.190
Amata Sora!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.500
Yes, sir!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:19.620
Andy!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:20.990
Are you okay, Andy?

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:22.860
He took the hit for me...

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.490
We have to Unite right now, Mix!

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:26.940
What? Amata?

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:29.250
Why do you look so disappointed?

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.250
Mix, don't let Andy's sacrifice go to waste.

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:36.040
Can't you feel it? It's the feelings he left behind.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:39.510
He's still waiting to fill those holes within you.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:40.840
Mikono...

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.390
All right!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.520
Big Bang Union Redux!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.900
Go, Aquarion!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.780
We're connected!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.610
We're connected, and my world is expanding!

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:05.280
This is what Union really is...

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.620
Andy?

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.870
See? Andy is still with us!

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.050
I can't believe it!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.130
But they repulsed each other so violently before!

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:23.760
Is this Mikono's power, Fudo?

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.770
Exactly. The power to connect.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.420
The power to connect...

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:37.560
The emotions Andy left behind...

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:39.650
are filling me.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:46.240
Aquarion Evol!

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:53.500
Union is a type of magic that connects people together!

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:57.130
Of course! It takes the relationships between the Elements...

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:00.300
and creates new powers from their connections!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.890
The Machine Angel!

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:07.510
We'll destroy it right here!

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:09.720
All weapons, ready!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:13.020
I'm filling Andy's holes!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:18.020
Absolute Clam!

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.200
What happened?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.880
What is this? What is happening?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.630
It's filling in all the openings!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.470
The machine can't handle it!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:48.760
Whoa...

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:51.770
This is Mix's Element power.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:55.080
Filling the barrels causes the enemy's weapons to backfire,

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.270
dealing damage proportionate to the strength of the attack.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:01.780
In one move, she fills their holes and digs their graves.

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:06.180
Humans are born from holes, and to holes they return.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:11.090
This is the power of the living grave!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:15.040
Jin!

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:27.880
I told you I was digging holes to dump trash in for the principal!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.220
I said I'm sorry, didn't I?

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:32.770
When I see a hole, I just have to fill it in!

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:36.440
They say the more they fight...

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.160
You helped them, Mikono.

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:38.770
Huh?

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:42.390
I think your connection power is incredible.

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:45.920
They were attracted to each other first.

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:48.780
My power doesn't do anything by itself.

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:51.180
Your power isn't for one person.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:53.200
It's for sharing with everyone.

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:56.120
I think it really fits you.

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:15.980
Ow, ow, ow!

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:19.770
Amata!

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:25.360
Love is forbidden.

00:22:33.270 --> 00:22:35.790
So that's the island where the Rare Iguras are.

00:24:11.990 --> 00:24:14.760
Are you kidding? We're getting another new student?

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:16.760
I can't wait to see him!

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:20.450
I can't decide if Amata's top or bottom with him, though...

00:24:20.450 --> 00:24:24.200
Next time on Aquarion Evol: The One-Eyed Transfer Student.
